# Docker Standards & Best Practices

## OBJETIVO

Enforza Docker best practices para deployment consistente con GPU support y health monitoring.

---

## DOCKERFILE - BASE IMAGE (OBLIGATORIO)

### MUST use PyTorch official image con CUDA

```dockerfile
# ✅ CORRECTO
FROM pytorch/pytorch:2.1.0-cuda12.1-cudnn8-runtime

# ❌ INCORRECTO
FROM python:3.9  # No incluye PyTorch ni CUDA
```

**Versiones recomendadas**:
- `pytorch/pytorch:2.1.0-cuda12.1-cudnn8-runtime` (actual)
- `pytorch/pytorch:2.0.1-cuda11.8-cudnn8-runtime` (legacy)

---

## DOCKERFILE - ENVIRONMENT (OBLIGATORIO)

```dockerfile
ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive
ENV TZ=UTC
ENV LANG=C.UTF-8
ENV LC_ALL=C.UTF-8
ENV PYTHONPATH=/app
ENV CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0
```

---

## DOCKERFILE - SYSTEM DEPENDENCIES (OBLIGATORIO)

### MUST install OpenCV dependencies

```dockerfile
RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
    libglib2.0-0 \
    libsm6 \
    libxext6 \
    libxrender-dev \
    libgomp1 \
    libgtk-3-0 \
    libgl1-mesa-glx \
    build-essential \
    cmake \
    wget \
    curl \
    && apt-get clean \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* \
    && rm -rf /tmp/*
```

---

## DOCKERFILE - HEALTH CHECK (CRÍTICO)

### MUST include health check

```dockerfile
HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=30s --start-period=5s --retries=3 \
    CMD curl -f http://localhost:8008/health || exit 1
```

---

## DOCKER-COMPOSE - GPU SUPPORT (CRÍTICO)

### MUST configure GPU resources

```yaml
version: '3.8'

services:
  service-name:
    build: .
    container_name: service-name-api
    ports:
      - "8008:8008"
    volumes:
      - ./models:/app/models:ro     # Read-only
      - ./results:/app/results       # Read-write
    environment:
      - CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0
      - PYTHONPATH=/app
    deploy:
      resources:
        reservations:
          devices:
            - driver: nvidia
              count: 1
              capabilities: [gpu]
    restart: unless-stopped
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD", "curl", "-f", "http://localhost:8008/health"]
      interval: 30s
      timeout: 10s
      retries: 3
```

---

## VOLUMES (OBLIGATORIO)

```yaml
volumes:
  - ./models:/app/models:ro      # Models (read-only)
  - ./results:/app/results        # Results (read-write)
  - ./temp:/app/temp             # Temp files (opcional)
```

**RAZÓN**: 
- Models read-only previene modificación accidental
- Results persistent entre restarts
- Temp files pueden ser volátiles

---

## RESTART POLICY (OBLIGATORIO)

```yaml
restart: unless-stopped
```

**Opciones**:
- `unless-stopped` ✅ (recomendado para producción)
- `always` (restart even if stopped manually)
- `on-failure` (solo si crash)
- `no` (solo para desarrollo)

---

## ANTI-PATTERNS (PROHIBIDOS)

### ❌ NEVER:
- Base images sin PyTorch/CUDA
- Omitir health check
- Hardcodear GPU en Dockerfile (usa env vars)
- Volumes read-write para models/ (security)
- Exponer todos los puertos (solo el necesario)

---

**Docker deployment debe ser reproducible y con health monitoring.**
